# Twenty in Pirate Years (outlands 143), the quest's own var at the completion: a level 40 Ninja, accepted,
# twentyInPirateYearsCS 4, the Trick Box and Quest[5][143]Prog 1 (GMs). Ryoma (the second talk of a pair: his default 94
# first): 134; finished: the box taken, the Anju and the Zushio, the var 0, Norg fame +20, the raw player:completeQuest.
# The raw completeQuest does no cleanup: Quest[5][143]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
char zone=Norg pos=-26.276,0.53,-8.323 job=NIN lvl=40
quest Outlands.TwentyInPirateYears accepted
charvar twentyInPirateYearsCS 4
keyitem TrickBox
charvar Quest[5][143]Prog 1             # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger Ryoma                           # default turn: 94
finish
trigger Ryoma                           # script, accepted, the box: 134
finish                                  # the box taken; the Anju, the Zushio; the var 0; fame +20; completed, Prog kept
